WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.208
One day, a mouse was lost in the jungle.

2
00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:14.360
"Oh, where am I? I am lost!" she cried.

3
00:00:14.361 --> 00:00:18.100
The little mouse could not find her way back home.

4
00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:20.663
"What am I going to do?"

5
00:00:20.664 --> 00:00:28.085
She felt afraid and hungry too.

6
00:00:28.086 --> 00:00:31.769
Just then, the mouse saw something yellow in the grass.

7
00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:37.893
"Oh boy!" She rushed to it and bit into it.

8
00:00:37.894 --> 00:00:42.840
The mouse did not realize that it was the tail of a big lion.

9
00:00:42.841 --> 00:00:47.599
"Who dared to bite my tail!" the lion roared.

10
00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.865
The mouse was quite surprised and trembled.

11
00:00:50.866 --> 00:00:56.158
"Oh no! Oh, my king, I am sorry.

12
00:00:56.159 --> 00:01:00.197
Please, please forgive me!"

13
00:01:00.198 --> 00:01:06.008
"What is this? You are nothing but a little mouse," said the lion.

14
00:01:06.009 --> 00:01:08.520
"How dare you bite my tail!"

15
00:01:08.521 --> 00:01:12.037
The lion opened his mouth to eat the mouse.

16
00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:17.828
"Wait, wait! I am too small to eat," cried the mouse.

17
00:01:17.829 --> 00:01:20.417
"Please, let me go.

18
00:01:20.418 --> 00:01:23.977
I promise I will help you someday!"

19
00:01:23.978 --> 00:01:28.235
"What?" laughed the lion.

20
00:01:28.236 --> 00:01:32.527
"How can you, a tiny mouse, help me?

21
00:01:32.528 --> 00:01:36.610
Ha-ha! I am the ruler of this jungle.

22
00:01:36.611 --> 00:01:39.370
I do not need anyone's help.

23
00:01:39.371 --> 00:01:44.340
But since you made me laugh, I will let you go.

24
00:01:44.341 --> 00:01:47.296
What a funny mouse!"

25
00:01:47.297 --> 00:01:49.043
"Oh, thank you!

26
00:01:49.044 --> 00:01:50.888
But you will see.

27
00:01:50.889 --> 00:01:54.123
Someday I will help you!"

28
00:01:54.124 --> 00:01:59.312
Then the mouse quickly ran away before the lion changed his mind.

29
00:01:59.313 --> 00:02:03.691
A few days later, the mouse heard an awful roaring noise.

30
00:02:03.692 --> 00:02:07.486
"Oh my, what could that be?

31
00:02:07.487 --> 00:02:11.218
Maybe it is the lion in trouble!"

32
00:02:11.219 --> 00:02:16.354
So the curious mouse ran quickly toward the sound.

33
00:02:16.355 --> 00:02:19.966
The mouse found the lion captured in a strong net.

34
00:02:19.967 --> 00:02:21.805
The lion looked sad.

35
00:02:21.806 --> 00:02:24.638
He looked like he needed some help.

36
00:02:24.639 --> 00:02:29.168
"Aha! Here is my chance to help him."

37
00:02:29.169 --> 00:02:32.110
The mouse ran to the lion's side.

38
00:02:32.111 --> 00:02:35.155
"My king, do not worry!

39
00:02:35.156 --> 00:02:38.419
I am here to help you!"

40
00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.218
"Oh, it's you again.

41
00:02:41.219 --> 00:02:45.596
But how can you help me?" asked the lion.

42
00:02:45.597 --> 00:02:49.013
"You are too small to help me!"

43
00:02:49.014 --> 00:02:53.004
"Just watch! I will bite through the net.

44
00:02:53.005 --> 00:02:55.095
Then you can escape."

45
00:02:55.096 --> 00:02:57.495
The mouse chewed and chewed.

46
00:02:57.496 --> 00:03:02.802
At last, the lion was able to crawl through a hole in the net.

47
00:03:02.803 --> 00:03:07.194
"Oh, thank you, Mouse," said the lion.

48
00:03:07.195 --> 00:03:11.043
"You kept your promise and saved my life!

49
00:03:11.044 --> 00:03:17.537
I will never judge someone by her size again!"
